Package: Battlefield
Type: Package
Title: Swiss-army toolkit for selecting niche fronts and invasive margins.
Version: 0.0.99
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jean-Philippe","Villemin",email="jpvillemin@gmail.com",role="aut",comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1838-5880")))
Description: Battlefield is a Swiss-army toolkit to define and extract spatial 
front regions—niche borders, invasive margins, and cluster interfaces—from
spatial transcriptomics or clustered tissue maps. It provides margin-aware
spot selection to build consistent comparison groups 
(front vs core, front vs background, interface vs non-interface)
upstream of downstream analyses such as differential gene expression 
and cell–cell communication (ligand–receptor) inference.
URL: https://github.com/ZheFrench/BattleField
BugReports: https://github.com/ZheFrench/BattleField/issues
